1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 16=

10
00:01:01,420 --> 00:01:06,540
(Prisoner)

11
00:01:11,310 --> 00:01:13,270
- (Shen Li.)
- (Cui Hong.)

12
00:01:13,270 --> 00:01:15,220
- (To let you die just like this)
- (I imagine you're in such agony now)

13
00:01:16,270 --> 00:01:18,460
- (that you wish you were dead)
- (would be letting you off too easily.)

14
00:01:18,460 --> 00:01:19,990
(even more than I do.)

15
00:01:25,540 --> 00:01:27,060
It is noon.

16
00:01:27,590 --> 00:01:28,630
Carry out the execution.

17
00:01:52,390 --> 00:01:54,110
It was clearly
Your Majesty who saved my life.

18
00:01:55,260 --> 00:01:57,260
Why must you tell everyone

19
00:01:57,860 --> 00:01:58,860
that I saved Your Majesty?

20
00:02:00,300 --> 00:02:01,110
Wouldn't that mean

21
00:02:01,140 --> 00:02:02,420
I'm taking credit
for something I didn't do?

22
00:02:02,590 --> 00:02:04,420
Since you've taken the credit

23
00:02:04,980 --> 00:02:06,180
and earned yourself a fine reputation,

24
00:02:07,110 --> 00:02:10,260
you must do something
important for me in return.

25
00:02:10,830 --> 00:02:11,420
Very well.

26
00:02:12,980 --> 00:02:15,950
I will brave any danger

27
00:02:16,700 --> 00:02:17,620
without hesitation.

28
00:02:19,670 --> 00:02:20,510
Eunuch Li.

29
00:02:20,900 --> 00:02:21,420
Your Majesty.

30
00:02:22,780 --> 00:02:23,670
At your service.

31
00:02:45,870 --> 00:02:47,670
Is Deputy Director Shen here?

32
00:02:49,980 --> 00:02:50,950
Greetings, Eunuch Li.

33
00:02:52,140 --> 00:02:53,670
Deputy Director Shen.

34
00:02:55,260 --> 00:02:58,230
His Majesty hasn't seen
Mr. Xie for some time,

35
00:02:58,620 --> 00:03:01,420
so he sent me
to invite him from Shuyu Study.

36
00:03:01,870 --> 00:03:05,260
But even the door knocker
was covered in dust,

37
00:03:06,300 --> 00:03:07,740
so I came here to trouble you.

38
00:03:09,370 --> 00:03:10,580
Deputy Director Shen,

39
00:03:11,020 --> 00:03:13,700
do you happen to know
where Mr. Xie has gone?

40
00:03:17,670 --> 00:03:18,350
So,

41
00:03:19,980 --> 00:03:21,740
how long do you intend
to keep me imprisoned?

42
00:03:24,540 --> 00:03:25,510
Until I die.

43
00:03:28,180 --> 00:03:29,550
Master has always come
and gone as he pleases.

44
00:03:29,770 --> 00:03:32,350
Perhaps he found some secluded place
in the misty mountains

45
00:03:32,390 --> 00:03:33,230
to go into seclusion.

46
00:03:33,790 --> 00:03:36,140
He may not return for quite some time.

47
00:03:38,700 --> 00:03:39,700
I see.

48
00:03:40,140 --> 00:03:42,580
Then that is what
I shall report to His Majesty.

49
00:03:43,540 --> 00:03:44,070
Very well.

50
00:03:45,390 --> 00:03:46,980
If Mr. Xie returns,

51
00:03:47,540 --> 00:03:50,740
please have someone
inform the Directorate of Ceremonial,

52
00:03:52,020 --> 00:03:54,190
so I can prepare a carriage

53
00:03:54,650 --> 00:03:56,340
to escort Mr. Xie into the palace.

54
00:03:57,460 --> 00:03:58,190
Of course.

55
00:04:04,670 --> 00:04:05,460
Take care, Eunuch Li.

56
00:04:06,910 --> 00:04:08,910
(His Majesty
isn't looking for Xie Yungui.)

57
00:04:09,580 --> 00:04:11,260
(He's looking for the weakness
I can no longer hide,)

58
00:04:12,300 --> 00:04:14,110
(the attachment I should
never have allowed myself.)

59
00:04:30,700 --> 00:04:31,300
Do you

60
00:04:33,580 --> 00:04:35,910
have nothing at all to say to me?

61
00:04:39,790 --> 00:04:40,350
No.

62
00:04:46,630 --> 00:04:47,390
Let me ask you.

63
00:04:49,740 --> 00:04:51,230
If you had found

64
00:04:52,140 --> 00:04:54,070
no clue to that medical book through me,

65
00:04:56,190 --> 00:04:57,070
would you have

66
00:04:57,980 --> 00:04:59,860
done to me what you
did to the 37 members

67
00:04:59,910 --> 00:05:00,790
of the Shen family?

68
00:05:01,190 --> 00:05:02,230
Does that still matter?

69
00:05:02,580 --> 00:05:03,230
It does.

70
00:05:05,190 --> 00:05:06,630
It may not matter to someone like you,

71
00:05:06,670 --> 00:05:07,670
but it matters to me.

72
00:05:13,660 --> 00:05:15,020
Xiao Jing created the poison soldiers

73
00:05:17,700 --> 00:05:19,220
even without
the epidemic poison chapter.

74
00:05:20,190 --> 00:05:21,830
You went to such lengths

75
00:05:22,310 --> 00:05:23,460
to create such monsters.

76
00:05:23,460 --> 00:05:24,410
What are you planning to do with them?

77
00:05:26,870 --> 00:05:27,950
Conquer cities and seize territory?

78
00:05:29,430 --> 00:05:30,630
Overthrow the throne?

79
00:05:31,990 --> 00:05:32,660
Or

80
00:05:33,460 --> 00:05:35,550
do you intend to slaughter
everyone in this world?

81
00:05:40,140 --> 00:05:41,870
Do human lives

82
00:05:42,700 --> 00:05:44,140
mean so little to you?

83
00:05:52,550 --> 00:05:53,950
Answer me!

84
00:05:55,550 --> 00:05:56,390
(Shen Li.)

85
00:05:58,140 --> 00:06:00,390
(From now on, you must face
all the evil in this world)

86
00:06:02,390 --> 00:06:04,260
(on your own.)

87
00:06:07,510 --> 00:06:19,870
- Welcome back in triumph, General Xiao.
- Welcome back in triumph, General Xiao.

88
00:06:32,870 --> 00:06:33,700
Greetings, Your Majesty.

89
00:06:38,340 --> 00:06:39,340
General Xiao.

90
00:06:40,140 --> 00:06:41,220
Your victory over the Snow Kingdom

91
00:06:41,220 --> 00:06:42,390
has brought glory to our realm.

92
00:06:42,530 --> 00:06:43,970
Your achievement
will be remembered for generations.

93
00:06:44,510 --> 00:06:46,550
I am greatly pleased.

94
00:06:47,780 --> 00:06:48,460
Bestow the wine.

95
00:06:50,140 --> 00:06:52,510
Bestow the imperial wine.

96
00:07:03,700 --> 00:07:04,660
(The man-eating flower.)

97
00:07:05,830 --> 00:07:06,780
(How is that possible?)

98
00:07:07,460 --> 00:07:09,260
(Master clearly
had the man-eating flower mark.)

99
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:12,680
(The one who massacred
the Shen family that night...)

100
00:07:13,460 --> 00:07:14,630
(Wasn't it Master?)

101
00:07:16,100 --> 00:07:17,310
(It was Xiao Jing.)

102
00:07:26,630 --> 00:07:27,830
I, Xiao Jing,

103
00:07:28,630 --> 00:07:29,900
thank Your Majesty for this great honor.

104
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:34,100
I am willing to serve Your Majesty

105
00:07:34,750 --> 00:07:36,070
and defend this realm

106
00:07:36,660 --> 00:07:37,700
at any cost,

107
00:07:38,550 --> 00:07:39,660
without hesitation.

108
00:07:41,310 --> 00:07:43,260
- May Heaven bless our realm.
- May Heaven bless our realm.

109
00:07:43,580 --> 00:07:48,070
- Long live the Emperor!
- Long live the Emperor!

110
00:07:53,550 --> 00:07:54,900
Greetings, Your Majesty.

111
00:08:04,070 --> 00:08:05,340
Ten years ago,

112
00:08:06,340 --> 00:08:07,990
when I found him,

113
00:08:09,700 --> 00:08:11,580
he was wrapped in a tattered blanket,

114
00:08:12,220 --> 00:08:14,310
shivering in the heavy snow.

115
00:08:18,780 --> 00:08:20,430
Seeing him alone with no one to rely on,

116
00:08:20,780 --> 00:08:22,100
I took pity on him.

117
00:08:22,190 --> 00:08:22,830
Slow down.

118
00:08:27,660 --> 00:08:28,950
I can never repay you

119
00:08:29,100 --> 00:08:30,310
for saving my life.

120
00:08:30,430 --> 00:08:32,190
I am willing to follow you
for the rest of my life

121
00:08:32,390 --> 00:08:33,510
and risk my life without hesitation.

122
00:08:38,510 --> 00:08:41,260
Later, I brought him back to the palace

123
00:08:41,700 --> 00:08:42,830
and trained him with great care.

124
00:08:45,510 --> 00:08:46,630
I treated him

125
00:08:46,870 --> 00:08:48,990
just as he later treated you,

126
00:08:49,100 --> 00:08:50,260
teaching him everything I knew.

127
00:08:56,220 --> 00:08:57,870
Ten years passed,

128
00:08:59,900 --> 00:09:02,510
and Xie Yungui became accomplished
in both civil and martial arts,

129
00:09:03,630 --> 00:09:05,100
and one of my most trusted aides.

130
00:09:13,020 --> 00:09:14,020
Years ago,

131
00:09:14,580 --> 00:09:16,020
I gave him a mission

132
00:09:17,660 --> 00:09:20,190
to gather evidence
of Cui Hong and his faction's crimes.

133
00:09:20,190 --> 00:09:21,260
(Order)

134
00:09:22,140 --> 00:09:24,660
The night your entire family
was massacred,

135
00:09:25,900 --> 00:09:27,190
he was outside the Shen Residence,

136
00:09:27,700 --> 00:09:29,580
keeping watch on Cui Hong's faction.

137
00:09:31,220 --> 00:09:32,670
When the massacre occurred,

138
00:09:33,170 --> 00:09:34,680
he was about to return
to the palace and report to me,

139
00:09:36,030 --> 00:09:39,830
but on the way, he happened upon you,
who had survived against all odds.

140
00:09:41,340 --> 00:09:42,190
Now,

141
00:09:42,670 --> 00:09:44,790
your third enemy has revealed himself.

142
00:09:45,910 --> 00:09:47,030
Do you know

143
00:09:48,030 --> 00:09:49,070
who he is?

144
00:09:53,700 --> 00:09:54,340
Xiao Jing.

145
00:09:57,070 --> 00:09:57,980
Good. Now you know.

146
00:09:59,340 --> 00:10:01,980
Make sure you don't kill the wrong man.

147
00:10:04,620 --> 00:10:05,860
Go to No. 7 Guozi Street

148
00:10:05,860 --> 00:10:07,100
and find an elderly woman.

149
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:08,950
She will tell you

150
00:10:09,460 --> 00:10:10,550
what you wish to know.

151
00:10:28,500 --> 00:10:29,150
Excuse me,

152
00:10:29,380 --> 00:10:30,950
is this No. 7 Guozi Street?

153
00:10:31,860 --> 00:10:32,340
Miss,

154
00:10:32,500 --> 00:10:33,500
you are...

155
00:10:33,860 --> 00:10:35,430
I'd like to ask you about someone.

156
00:10:35,980 --> 00:10:36,580
Miss,

157
00:10:36,740 --> 00:10:37,860
who are you looking for?

158
00:10:39,070 --> 00:10:40,070
Xie Yungui.

159
00:10:57,650 --> 00:11:00,510
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

160
00:11:01,270 --> 00:11:04,210
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

161
00:11:04,870 --> 00:11:07,690
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

162
00:11:08,540 --> 00:11:11,530
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

163
00:11:12,380 --> 00:11:15,700
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

164
00:11:16,040 --> 00:11:19,330
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

165
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:26,160
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

166
00:11:26,950 --> 00:11:34,040
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

167
00:11:36,540 --> 00:11:44,390
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

168
00:11:44,690 --> 00:11:46,500
♪I stand here today♪

169
00:11:46,640 --> 00:11:51,150
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

170
00:11:51,150 --> 00:11:58,640
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

171
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:00,570
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

172
00:12:00,570 --> 00:12:02,970
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

173
00:12:03,410 --> 00:12:10,260
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
